<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="NEH" style="id">Nehemiah</book>
  <para style="h">Nehemiah</para>
  <para style="toc1">Nehemiah</para>
  <para style="toc2">Nehemiah</para>
  <para style="mt">Nehemiah</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hakaliah tapa Nehemiah thute: Kisleu kha, kum sawmnihna kum a, Susan Inpi a ka om in, hichi a honghi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hananiah, ka unaute lak a khat, a hong a, amah leh Judah a kipan mi kuate hiam; amaute kiang ah saltanna a kipan a nutsiat a omte, Judah suaktate tanchin leh Jerusalem thu ka dong hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amau ka kiang ah, “Huailai bial a saltanna a kipan omlaite gimthuakna thupi thuak leh simmawh in a om uh: Jerusalem kulhbangte leng a chim a, a kongpite leng mei in a kang” a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Huan hichi ahi a, hiai thute ka zaklai in, ka tu a ka kap a, ni bangzah hiam ka sun a; van Pathian ma ah an ka ngawl a ka thum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Aw Toupa , van Pathian, Pathian thupi leh lauhuai, amah it a, a thupiakte zuite tung a thukhun theigige leh chitna nei gige:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuin na bil in hon hungaih henla, na mitte hong kihong hen, huchi a na sikha thumna, huai hun a, sun leh zan a, na sikhate Israel tate adia, nangmah tung a ka hihkhelh uh, Israel tate khelhna thupha tawi a, ka thumna n’on ngaihkhiaksakna din: ahi, kei leh ka pa inkawte ka khialta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Thanghuaitak in na tung ah ka gamta ta ua, na thupiakte ka zuita kei ua, na sikha Mosi kiang a na thupiak, thusehte, leh vaihawmte.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />‘Theigige in, k’on ngen ahi, na sikha Mosi kiang a thu na piak, Na tatlek uh leh mite lak ah k’on thehzak ding:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Himahleh ka kiang a na hongkik ua, ka thupiakte na zuih ua na hih uleh, delhkhiak a na omna uh vantawp mun ah himahleh, huai a kipan in amaute ka kaikhawm ding a, ka min omna dia ka mun telsa ah amau ka pikhawm ding’ chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuin hiaite, na thilhihtheihna thupi leh, na banhat a na tatsa, na sikhate leh na mite ahi uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Aw Toupa , k’on ngen ahi, na min laudansiam nuamsa, na sikha thumna leh, na sikhate thumna na bil in hungaih hen: k’on ngen ahi, tuni in na sikha lohchingsak inla, hiai mi mitmuh in a kiang ah chitna pia in” a chi hi. Kei bel kumpipa nou tawipa ka hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kumpipa Artaksarses vaihawm kum sawmnih, Nisan kha in, a ma a uain a omlai in hichi ahi, uain ka la a, kumpipa kiang ah ka pia hi. A ma ah nidang in dahmel ka pu nai kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kumpipa’n ka kiang ah, “Na chi lah a na kei a, bangchi a dahmel pu na hia? Hiai bangmah dang ahi kei a lungtang dahna ahi” a chi hi. Huaitak in ka lau mahmah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kumpipa kiang ah, “Kumpipa tangtawn in dam hen: bangchi’n ka mel a dahlou dia, ka pipute hante omna, khopi, segawp a om a, huai a kongpite mei in kangbei ahi?” ka chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kumpipa’n ka kiang ah, “Ahihleh bang ahia na nget?” a chi hi. Huchi in van Pathian kiang ah ka thumta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kumpipa kiang ah, “Kumpipa kipah lam a hih a, na mitmuh a na sikha in deihsakna a muhleh, Judah gam ah, ka pipute han omna khopi ka bawl theihna ding in kei honsawl in” ka chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kumpipa’n ka kiang ah, kumpinu leng a kiang ah a tu a, “Na khualzinna bang tan a sawt ahi dia? Chikchiang in na hong kiknawn dia?” a chi hi. Huchi in honsawl kumpipa kipahlam ahi a; amah hun ka pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Huailou in kumpipa kiang ah, “Kumpipa kipahlam a hih a, Judah gam tan ka tun mateng a kei a hon paisak zel theihna ding un, luipi khen a ukpipate kiang a piak ding laikhakte honpe lechin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Inn toh kizom kulh kongpite ading leh, khopi kulhbangte ading leh, ka lutna ding inn ading a bawl ding inkamte bawlna dia sing a hon piakna ding in, kumpipa gammang kempa Asaph kiang ah laikhak hon khaksak lechin” ka chi hi. Huchi in kumpipa’n ka tung a ka Pathian khut hoih a om bang in hon phalsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Huchi in luipi khen a ukpipate kiang ka hongtung a, a kiang uah kumpipa laikhakte ka pia hi. Huchi in kumpipa’n honzui ding in sepaihpawl heutute leh sakol tungtuangmite a sawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Horon mi, Sanballat leh, sikha Tobiah, Ammon min a zak un, a lungkham sak mahmah a, Israel tate hoihna zong mi khat hongpai a om ngal hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huchi in Jerusalem ah ka hong a, huai ah ni thum ka omta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Zan in ka thou a, kei leh ka kiang a om mi tawmchikte; Jerusalem adia hih ding ka lungtang sung a ka Pathian in bang ahia a koih mi kuamah ka hilh kei a: ka kiang ah ganta, a tung a ka tuanna ganta chihlouh, leng a omkei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Zan in gulpi tuileh lam, ekvum kongpi lam ah, guam kongpi a pai in ka pawtkhia a, a chimsa, Jerusalem kulhbangte leh, mei a kangsa kongpite ka velta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuikhuk kongpi leh kumpipa dil ah ka hoh a: himahleh ka nuai a om ganta paina ding mun a omkei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Luita zui in zan in ka paitou a, kulhbang ka vel a; ka kiknawn a, guam kongpi ah ka lut a, huchi in ka kiknawnta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Huchi in ka paina lam hiam, ka hih hiam vaihawmmite’n a theikei uh; Judate kiang ah leng, siampute hiam, miliante hiam, vaihawmte hiam leh nasep sem midangte kiang ah leng ka gen naikei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Huan a kiang uah, “I dinmun uh hoihlouh dan na mu ua, Jerusalem a siatkhit dan, huai a kongpite mei a kat khitdan: simmawh a i om nawnlouh na ding in, kisa un Jerusalem bang i lamnawn ding uh” ka chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Huchi in ka tung a hoih ka Pathian khut tanchin ka kiang a a gen kumpipa thute leng amau ka hilh a; Huchi in amau, “Thou ni’n lamni” a chi uhi. Huchi in nasep hoih sem ding in a khutte uh a hatsakta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Himahleh Horon mi Sanballat leh, Ammon mi sikha Tobiah leh Arabia mi Geshem in a zak un, a hon nuihsan ua, a hon simmawh ua, “Bang thil ahia na hih uh? Kumpipa tung a hel ding na hi uhia?” a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Amau ka dawng a a kiang uah, “Van Pathian, aman kou a hon lohching sak ding, huaiziak in kou a sikhate ka thou ding ua ka lam ding uh: himahleh nou Jerusalem ah thuneihna, theihgigena leh tan na neikei uhi” ka chi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huchi in siampu lian Eliasib a unau siampute toh a thou ua, belam kongpi a bawl ua; a hih siangthou ua, a kongkhakte a tung ua; Hameah insang tan in a hih siangthou ua, Hananel insang tan in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Amah zom in Jeriko mite’n a lam uhi. Amau zom in Imri tapa Zakkur in a lam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hassenah tapate’n ngasa kongpi a hih ua; a inkamte a khung ua, a kongkhakte a tung ua, a kalhnate leh a kalhnatawnte.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amau zom in Uriah tapa, Hakkoz tapa, Meremoth in a bawlpha hi. Amau zom in Mesullam Berekiah tapa, Meshezabel tapa in a bawlpha hi. Amau zom in Baana tapa Zadok in a bawlpha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amau zom in Tekoa mite’n a bawlpha ua; himahleh a miliante un a Toupa uh nasepna ah a nakpan nuam kei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kongpi lui pen Paseah tapa Jehoiada leh Besodeiah tapa Mesullam in a bawlpha ua, a inkamte a khung ua, a kongkhakte a tung ua, a kalhnate leh, a kalhnatawnte.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amau zom in Gibeon mi Melatiah leh Meronoth mi, Jadon, Gibeon mite, Mizpah mite, luipi khen a ukpipa mangtutphah toh kizomte’n a bawlhoih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Amah zom in Harhaiah, dangkaeng sekmite tapa Uzziel in a bawlhoih hi. Amah zom in gimlim bawlmite tapa Hananiah in a bawlhoih a, kulhbang za tanpha in Jerusalem a bubitsak uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Amaute zom in Jerusalem seh kimkhat a vaihawmpa, Hur tapa Rephaiah in a bawlpha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Amau zom in Harumaph tapa Jedaiah in, amah inn sunhial in a bawlpha a. Amah zom in Hasabneiah tapa Hattush in a bawlpha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Malkijah, Harim tapa leh Hasub Pahath moab tapa in a mundang leh meipi insang a bawlpha uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Amah zom in Jerusalem seh kimkhat a vaihawmpa, Hallohesh tapa Sallum in, amah leh a tanute toh, a bawlpha uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Guam kongpi pen Hanun leh, Zanoah a tengte’n a bawlpha ua, a lam ua, a kongkhakte a tung ua, a kalhnate leh, a kalhnatawnte leh, ekvum kongpi lam a kulhbang tong sang khat toh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Huchi in Bethhakkerem seh a vaihawmpa, Rekab tapa Malkijah in ekvum kongpi a bawlhoih a, a kongkhakte, a kalhnate leh, a tung a a kalhnatawnte a lam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mizpah seh a vaihawmpa, Kolhozeh tapa Sallum in tuikhuk kongpi a bawlhoih a; a lam a, a vuka, kongkhakte, kalhnate, leh kalhnatawnte leh, kumpipa huan kiang a Siloah dil bang, David khopi a kipan a sukpai leichial tan in a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Amah nung in Azbuk tapa Nehemiah, Bethzur gam kimkhat a vaihawmpa’n, David han toh kimatuah mun leh, dil bawltawm chiang leh, mi hatte inn tan in a bawlpha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Amah nung in, Levite, Bani tapa Rehumte’n a bawlpha ua. Amah zom in Keilah seh kimkhat a vaihawmpa Asabiah in, amah sehding in a bawlhoih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Amah nung in a unaute uh, Keilah seh kimkhat a vaihawmpa, Henadad tapa Bavai in a bawlhoih hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Amah zom in Mizpah vaihawmpa, Jeshua tapa Ezer in, sehdang, kulhbang kawina tak a galvan in tan a paitouhna sun in a bawlhoih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Amah nung in Zabbai tapa Baruk in seh dang, kulhbang kawina a kipan siampu lian Eliasib inn kongkhak chiang a bawlhoih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Amah nung in Hakkoz tapa Uria tapa Meremoth in sehdang, Eliasib in kongkhak a kipan Eliasib inn tawpna chiang a bawlpha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Amah nung in, phaizang mite, siampute’n a bawlpha uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Amau nung in Benjamin leh Hasub in a inn pha un a bawlhoih ua. Amau nung in Ananiah tapa Maaseiah tapa Azariah inn amah inn sik ah a bawlhoih a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Amah nung in Henadad tapa Binui in sehdang, Azariah inn a kipan kulhbang kawina tan, leh a ning chiang, a bawlhoih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Uzai tapa Palal in kulhbang kawina sunchiang a bawlhoih a, kumpipa inn tungnung zaw a kipan a hong dingkhetou insang, venna pisa kiang a om toh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Amah nung in Parosh tapa Pedaiah leh tempul nasem Ophel a tengteng suahlam pang tui kongpi leh insang lawkkhia zawn tan a bawlhoih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Amah khit in Tekoa mite’n seh dang, Ophel kulhbang chiangpha, insang thupi ding khetou sun in a bawlpha uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Siampute’n sakol kongpi tunglam, michih in amah inn tung sun chiat in a bawlpha uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Amaute nung in Immer tapa Zadok in amah inn tung suntou chiang a bawlpha a. Amah nung in suahlam kongpi ngakpa Sekaniah tapa Semaiah in, a bawlpha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Amah nung in Selemiah tapa Hananiah leh Hanun Zalaph tapa gukna in seh dang a bawlpha uhi. Amah nung in Berekiah tapa Mesullam in a dantan tungzawn a bawlpha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Amah nung in dangkaeng sekmite tapa Malkijah in Nithinimte inn leh, sumsinmite inn chiang, Hammipkad kongpi zawnchiang leh, a ning a kahtouhna chiang a bawlpha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Huan a ning a kahtouhna leh belam kongpi kikal dangkaeng sekmite leh sumsinmite’n a bawlpha uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Himahleh hichi ahi a, kulhbang i lam uh chih Sanballat in a zak in, a hehta a, nakpitak in a thangpai a, Judate a kouta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Huchi in a unaute leh Samari sepaih pawl ma ah thu a gen a, “Hiai Judah zawngkhalte’n bang ahia a hih uh? Kihihhat ding uhia? Kithoih ding uh hia? Ni khat a zoh sawm uhia? A kangsa ahi chih mu napi in, ninneng sunvum a kipan a suangte bawlthak ding uhia?” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Huailai in Ammon mi Tobiah a kiang ah a om a, “Aman, a inlam uh, sehal khat kuantou leh, a suang bang uh a laichim ding” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Za in aw ka Pathian; simmawh in lah ka om ngal ua: a hon kouna uh amau lutung ah kiksak inla, saltanna gam a loh ding in amau pia in:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A ginatlouhna uh khuh kenla, na ma a kipan a khelhna uh nulmang in omsak ken: inlamte ma ah lah nang a hon hehsakta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Huchi in bang ka bawl ua; bang tengteng, a sandan kim chiang in a kizomta hi: mite’n lah nna sem ding in lungsim a nei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Himahleh hichi ahi a, Sanballat, Tobiah, Arab mite, Ammon mite leh Ashdod mite’n Jerusalem kulhbangte bawlphatna in ma a sawntou zel a, a kitapsiatna a kibawlpha, chih a zak un, a thangpai mahmah uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Avek ua hong kuan a Jerusalem dou ding leh, huai a buaina omsak ding in a kikum khawmta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Himahleh i Pathian kiang ah i thum ua, sun leh zan a amaute vil ding i koih ua, amau ziak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Judah in, “Puakgik pawte hatna a bahta a, ninneng tampi a om; huchi in kulhbang bawl theilou i hi uh” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />I melmate un, “A lak uh i hongtun ua, amaute i thah ua, nasep i khawlsak matan a theikei ding ua, muh leng a mu kei ding uh” a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hichi ahi a, amau kiang a teng Judahte a hong pailai un, “Sawmvei i kiang uah mun tengteng a kipan hondou ding uh ahi” a honchi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Huaiziak in kulhbang nunglam mun a mun niampen pen, mun awngthawlte ah, ka koih a, mite a inkuan kuan uh dungzui in a namsaute utoh, a teipite utoh, a thalpeute utoh ka koih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Huchi in ka en a, ka thou a, miliante leh, vaihawmmite leh mipi dangte kiang ah, “Amau lau kei un: Toupa thupi leh lauhuai theigige unla, na unaute uh, na tapate uh leh na tanute uh ading in galdou un, na zite uh leh na innte uh ading in” ka chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hichi ahia, i melmate’n i na theita ua, Pathian in a thusawm uh bangmahlou a suaksak a, kulhbang bawl ding in i vek un michih a nasepna munah i kilehnawnta uh chih a zalai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Huchi in hichi ahia huai hun a kipan in, ka sikhate lak a a kimkhat nasepna ah a pang ua, a lak ua kimkhat in teipi, lum leh thalpeu leh sik puanakte a len ua; vaihawmmite Judah inkawte nung ah a omvek uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kulhbang bawlte leh, vangik pawte’n a puaklai un, michih in a khutte uh a khat nasepna a nasem in, a khut khatlam a galvan tawi in;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Inlam mite’n, michih in a namsau a pang ah khaisa a nei in, huchi in a lamtou zel uhi. Pengkul mutpa ka kiang ah a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Huchi in miliante kiang leh, vaihawmmite kiang ah leh mite lak a a dangdangte kiang ah, “nasep thupi in, a tam a, kulhbang tung ah i kikhenzak ua, kigamlat tak in:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Koilai mun peuh a pengkul ging na zakna uah, i kiang uah huai lam ah kuan un; i Pathian un gal hondou sak ding ahi” ka chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Nna i sem ua: a lak ua a kimkhat in zingsang kipat a kipan aksite hong kilat matan teipi a tawi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Huchi mah bang in huailai in mite kiang ah, michih a sikha toh Jerusalem sung ah giak hen, zan chiang a ei ding a galvil a hih a, sun chiang a na a sep theihna ding un, ka chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Huchi in ken leng, ka unaute’n leng, ka sikhate’n leng, kei hongzui galvil mite’n leng, i lak ua kuamah in i puante uh i suahkei ua, michih a galvan toh tui ah a hoh uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huailai in a unaute uh Judate dem a nakpitak a kikouna mite leh a zite uh a kipan a hong omta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kou, ka tapate leh ka tanute uh, tampi ka hi ua: ka nek ua ka hin theihna ding un, buh leh bal honpia un” chi pawl a hongom uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Ka loute uh, ka grephuante uh, ka innte uh ka zuak uhi: kial ziak in, buh leh bal honpia un” chi kuate hiam leng a om uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Ka loute uh leh ka grephuante ua dit ding in kumpipa siah ding in sum ka leitawi uh, chi mi khenkhat leng a om uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hinapi in ka sa uh ka unaute uh sa bang ahi a, ka tate uh lah amau tate bang: ngai un, ka tapate uh leh ka tanute uh sikhate hi ding in tanna ah ka pi ua, ka tanute uh lak a a khente tanna a pi in a omkhin man hial uhi: panpih theihna ka neikei ua; midangte’n lah ka loute uh leh ka grephuante uh a nei ngal ua” chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Huchi a a kikouna uleh hiai thute ka zak in ka heh mahmah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Huchih lai in ka kingaihtuah a, miliante leh vaihawmmite ka kiselpih a, a kiang uah, “Michih in a unau lak ah a pung na phut uh” ka chi hi. Huchi in amaute demna kikhawmpi thupi ka nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A kiang uah, “Khovelmite kiang a zuak a omsa, i unau Judahte i theih bang un i tanta ua; nou na unaute uh zuak un, i lak ua khot a om ding uh ahi maw?” ka chi hi. Amau a daidide ua, thu khat leng a neikei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Na thilhih uh a hoih kei: i melmate khovel mite’n hon simmawhna ziak un, i Pathian laudansiam a na om ding uh hilou hia? ka chi behlap hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Huchi mah bang in, ‘ka unaute leh ka sikhate leh ken amau kiang ah sum leh buh leh bal ka leitawi sak uhi. K’on ngen ahi, a pung omsak keini.’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />‘Pe nawn un, k’on ngen ahi, a kiang uah, tuni mahmah in, a loute uh, a grephuante, a olive huante uleh a innte uh, a sum uh a seh zana leng, buh leh bal, uain,’ leh sathau, amau a kipan na phutkhia uhi” ka chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Huchi in amau, “Ka pe nawn ding ua, amau a kipan bangmah ka ngiat kei ding uh; huchibang in ka hih ding ua, na chih mah bang in” a chi uhi. Ken siampute ka sam a, a kichiamna uh ka la a, huchi a hiai thuchiam bang a a hihna ding un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ken leng ka pheipi ka vuang a, “Hiai thuchiam bawllou peuhmah, a inn a kipan, a nasepna a kipan Pathian in hichibang in vuang hen; hichibang tak a vuan khiak ahi ding a, a hawm ding” ka chi hi. Huan khawmpite tengteng in, “Amen, Toupa phat in om hen” a chi uhi. Huchi in mite’n hiai thuchiam dungzui in a hih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Huailou in Judah gam a a ukpipa ding ua seh a ka omlai a kipan, kumpipa Artaksarses kum sawmnihna leh kum sawmthum leh nih chiang, huai bel, kum sawmlehnih ahi a, kei leh ka unaute’n ukpipa tanghou ka ne kei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Himahleh kei ma a ukpipa masate mite tung a mawhsak theih ahi ua, amau a kipan in tanghou leh uain a la uh, dangka sekel sawmli simlouh in; ahi, a sikhate uh nangawn in mite tung ah vai a hawm uhi: himahleh ken Pathian ka kihtak ziak in huchibang in ka hih kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ahi, huailou leng hiai kulhbang nasepna ah ka pang nilouhlouh a, gam himhim leng i leikei uh: ka sikhate tengteng huailam ah nasepna ah kaihkhawm in a om uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Huaiban ah ka dohkan ah Judahte leh vaihawmmite lak a mi za leh sawmnga, i kim i vel ua om khovelmite lak apan i kiang ua hongpaite chih louh, a om uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ni khat ading a bawlkholhsa bawngtal khat leh belam hoihhoih guk ahi ua; vasate leng kei dia bawlkholhsa in a om ua, huan ni sawm sung a khatvei uain chichih kipan koih hoih: hinapi in hiai mite tung a tanna a gik ziak in, ukpipa tanghou hiaite tengteng ziak in ka phut kei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Aw ka Pathian, hoihna ding in, hiai mite adia ka hih tengteng kei lam hon theigige in.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan hichi ahi a, kulhbang ka lamkhin a, huai ah khangkham a om nawnta kei chih, Sanballat, Tobiah, Geshem Arabia mi leh i melma dangdangte kiang a a ki tut lai in; huai huntan in kongpi kongkhakte tung naikei mah leng;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Sanballat leh Geshem in ka kiang ah mi a honsawl ua, “Hongpai in, Ono phaizang a khuate lak a khat ah kimuh khawmna i nei ding” chi in. Himahleh ka tung a gilou hih a ngaihtuah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Huchi in a kiang uah sawltakte ka sawl a, “Nna thupi ka seplai ahi, k’ong paisuk theikei: bangdia ka nna nusia a, na kiang ua ka hongsuk ziak a, nasep khawl ding ahia oi?” ka chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Huan hichibang ngen in livei ka kiang ah mi a honsawl ua; a ngeingei in amaute ka dawng zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Huchi in Sanballat in ka kiang ah hichibang in a ngaveina ding in a sikha a khut a laikhak honsa toh a honsawl a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Huai ah, “Namte lak ah a kigen a, Gasmu in a chi a, nang leh Judahte’n hel na tum uh; huai ading in kulhbang na lam hi: huchi in nang a kumpipa uh hi ding in, hiai thute dungzui in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Jerusalem a nang tanchin gen ding in zawlneite leng na sep a, Judah ah kumpipa a om chi in: huchi in tuin hiai thute dungzui in kumpipa kiang a tut ding ahi; Huaiziak in hong kuan inla, kihouna i nei ding” chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A kiang ah mi ka sawl a, “Na gen bang a huchibang thilhih a omkei a, himahleh na lungtang a kipan na phuahtawm ahi” chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Amau lah, hihlouh a hihna ding in, “Nasepna a kipan a khutte uh hatlouh sak in a om ding” chi a hon lausak a ut chiat ngal uhi. Himahleh tuin Aw Pathian, nang ka khutte hatsak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Khum a om, Mehetabel tapa Delaiah tapa Semaiah inn ah ka hoh a; aman, “Biakin sung ah, Pathian inn ah i kikhawm dia, huchi in biakin kongkhakte i khak ding: nang that dia hong ding uh lah ahi ngal ua; ahi, zan in nang that ding a hong ding uh ahi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ken bel, “Kei bang mi, taiding honsa maw? Huan kua ahia, huchi a omkei bang, a hinna humbitna dia biakin sung a hohnuam ding? Ka lut kei ding,” ka chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ka ngaihtuah a, huchi in, ngai in, Pathian in amah a sawlkei a; himahleh ka siatna ding in hiai genkholhna a genkheta hi: Tobiah leh Sanballat in amah a guai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hiai ading a goih ahi, ka launa ding leh, huchibang a hih a, khial a, thutut gilou ding a thubuai a neih theihna ding ua, kei a hon simmawh theihna ding un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Aw ka Pathian, Tobiah leh Sanballat a nasepte uh bangzel leh zawlneinu Noadiah leh, zawlnei dangte, lausak hontumte, theigige in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Huchi in Elul kha ni sawmnih leh nga ni, ni sawmnga leh nih sung in, kulhbang zoh in a omta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hichi ahi a, i melmate tengteng in huai a zak un, i kim i vel ua om khovelmi tengteng a lauta ua, a mitmuh ngei uah nakpitak in a lunglelta uhi: hiai nasep i Pathian hih ahi chih a thei ngal ua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Huailou in huailai in Judah miliante’n laikhak tampi Tobiah kiang ah a khak ua, amau kiang ah Tobiah laikhakte a hongtung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Amah Arah tapa Sekaniah tanu pasal a hih ziak in, Judah ah mi tampi amah lam a kichiam lah a om ngal ua; a tapa Jehohanan in Berekiah tapa Mesullam tanu zi in a nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Huailou leng ka ma ah a thil hoih hihte a gen ua, amah kiang ah ka thute a tunzel uhi. Huchi in Tobiah in laikhakte kei hon hihlau ding in a khak hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hichi a honghi a, kulhbang lamkhit a hih a, kongkhakte ka tun khit a, kongkhak ngakmite leh lasamite leh Levi mite seh a hihkhit nung un,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka unau Hanani leh Hananiah kulh ukpa kiang ah Jerusalem kepna ka pia a: mi ginom ahi a, tampi sang a Pathian laudansiam a hih ziak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A kiang ah, “Ni a sat mateng Jerusalem kongpite hon hi kei hen; galvilmi a dinlai un, kong khakte khak uhenla, amaute kalhkhum un: Jerusalem a tengte vengmi sep inla, michih amah dinmun ah, michih amah in zawn chiat ah” chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Khopi a za in a lian a: himahleh huai ah mite a tawm ua, innte lah lam ahi kei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Huchi in ka Pathian in ka lungtang miliante, vaihawmmite, mipite, kaikhawm ding in a koih a, huchi a khangsutna a sim a hihtheihna ding un. Huan a masapen a honglang amaute khangsutna laibu ka muta a, huai ah gelh a om ka mu hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hiaite bial naupangte ahi ua, Nebukadnezzar Babulon kumpipa’n a pimangte, huai pimang a omte lak a saltanna kipan a paitoute, Jerusalem leh Judah a kiknawn, michih amah khopi a kik;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Zerubbabel, Jeshua, Nehemiah, Azariah, Raamiah, Nahamani, Mordekai, Bilsan, Mispereth, Bigvai, Nehum, Baanah toh hong paite.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Israel mite lak a pasal zah: Parosh suante, sang nih za khat leh sawmsagih leh nih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Sephatiah suante, za thum sawmsagih leh nih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Arah suante, za guk sawmnga leh nih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Pahath moab suante, Jeshua leh Joab tate, sang nih leh za giat leh sawmlehgiat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Elam suan, sang khat za nih sawmnga leh li.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Zattu suan, za giat sawmli leh nga.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Zakkai suan, za sagih leh sawmguk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Binnui suan, za guk sawmli leh giat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Bebai suan, za guk sawmnih leh giat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Azgad suan, sang nih za thum sawmnih leh nih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Adonikam suan, za guk sawmguk leh sagih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Bigvai suan, sang nih sawmguk leh sagih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Adin suan, za guk sawmnga leh nga.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ater, Hezekiah suan, sawmkua leh giat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hasum suan, za thum sawmnih leh giat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Bezai suan, za thum sawmnih leh li.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Hariph suan, za khat leh sawmlehnih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Gibeon suan, sawmkua leh nga.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Bethlehem leh Netophath suan, za khat sawmgiat leh giat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Anathoth mite, za khat sawmnih leh giat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Bethazmaveth, mite sawmli leh nih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Kiriath-jearim, Kephirah, Beeroth suante, za sagih sawmli leh thum.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ramah leh Geba mite, za guk sawmnih leh khat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Mikmas suante, za khat leh sawmnih leh nih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Bethel leh Ai mite, za khat sawmnih leh thum.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Nebo dang mite, sawmnga leh nih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Elam dang suan, sang khat za nih sawmnga leh li.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Harim suan, za thum leh sawmnih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Jeriko suan, za thum sawmli leh nga.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Lod, Hadid leh Ono suante, za sagih sawmnih leh khat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Senaah suan, sang thum za kua leh sawmthum.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Siampute: Jedaiah suante, Jeshua inkuan a kipan, za kua sawmsagih leh thum.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Imer suante, sang khat sawmnga leh nih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Pashur suante, sang khat za nih sawmli leh sagih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Harim suante, sang khat leh sawmlehsagih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Levi mite: Jeshua, Kadmiel suante, Hodevah suante, sawmsagih leh li.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Lasamite: Asaph suante, za khat sawmli leh giat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Kongkhakngakte: Sallum, Ater, Talmon, Akkub, Hatita leh Sobai suante, za khat sawmthum leh giat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Temple nasemmi, Nithinim mite: Ziha, Hasupha, Tabbaoth;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Keros, Sia, Padon;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Lebana, Hagaba, Salmai;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Hanan, Giddel, Gahar;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Reaiah, Rezin, Nekoda;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Gazzam, Uzza, Paseah;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Besai, Meunim, Nephisesim;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Bakbuk, Hakupha, Harhur;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Bazlith, Mehida, Harsa;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Barkos, Sisera, Tamah;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />Neziah, leh Hatipha suante.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />Solomon sikhate tate: Sotai, Sophereth, Perida;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" />Jaala, Darkon, Giddel;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" />Sephatiah, Hattil, Zebaim mi Pokereth leh Ammon suante.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" />Nithinim mite tengteng leh Solomon sikhate suante, za thum leh sawmkua leh nih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" />Huan hiaite Telmelah, Telharsa, Kerub, Addon leh Immer a kipan paitoute ahi uh: himahleh a pipute uh inkawte, Israel a kipan ahi hiam chih a ensak theikei uhi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" />Delaiah, Tobiah leh Nekoda suante, za guk sawmli leh nih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" />Siampute a kipan: Habaiah, Koz leh Barzillai suan, Gilead mi Barzillai tanute lak a zi neipa min a tamsak uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" />Hiaite’n khangthusuina a sim a omte lak ah a min gelhna uh a zong ua, himahleh muh in a omkei: huaiziak in nin a sim ahi ua siamputna a kipan koihkhiak ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" />Ukpipa in a kiang uah, siampu khat Urim leh Thummim toh a hongsuah mateng thil siangthou penpente lak a neklouh ding chih a gen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" />Omkhawm tengteng avek un sing li leh sang nih leh za thum leh sawmguk,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" />A pasal sikhate uh leh a nungak sikhate uh, sang sagih za thum sawmthum leh sagihte, simlouh in: pasal lasa leh numei lasa za nih sawmli leh nga a nei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" />A sakolte uh za sagih sawmthum leh guk; a sakolneute uh, za nih sawmli leh nga;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" />A sangawngsaute, za li sawmthum leh nga; a sabiltungte uh sang guk za sagih leh sawmnih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" />Pipute inkawte lak a lupente lak a kipan khenkhatte nasem ding in a kipia uhi. Ukpipa in sumbawm ah dangkaeng darik sang khat, maiphiatkuang sawmnga, siampute puan za nga leh sawmthum a pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" />Huan pipute inkawte lak a lupente lak a khenkhatte’n dangkaeng darik sang sawmnih leh, dangka paund sang nih leh za nih a pia uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="72" style="v" />Mipite lak a a dangdangte piak dangkaeng darik sang sawmnih leh dangka paund sang nih leh, siampute puan sawmguk leh sagih ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="73" style="v" />Huchi in siampute, Levi mite, kongkhakngakte leh lasamite, mite lak a a khente leh, Nethinim mite leh Israel tengteng a khopite uah a tengta uhi. A kha sagihna a hongtun in, Israel tate a khopite uah a om uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huchi in mite tengteng tui kongpi mai a om mun lian ah mi khat bang in a kikhawm khawmta ua; Toupa’n Israel kiang a a piak, Mosi Dan laibu hontawi ding in Laigelhmi Ezra kiang ah thu a gen uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Siampu Ezra in omkhawmte, pasal leh numei, theihsiamna toh za thei ding tengteng ma ah kha sagihna ni khat ni’n danthu a honlata hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pasal leh numeite, leh theisiam thei dingte ma ah, zingkhang a kipan sunlai tanpha in tui kongpi mai a om mun lian ma ah a simta hi; huchi in mite tengteng in Dan laibu a bil uh a doh chiat uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Huai ding mah a a bawl uh, sing pulpit tung ah Laigelhmi Ezra ading a; a sik ah Mattithiah, Shema, Anaiah, Uriah, Hilkiah leh Maaseiah, a taklam pang ah ading ua; a veilam pang ah, Pedaiah, Misael, Malkiah, Hasum, Hasbaddana, Zekariah leh Mesullam.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Huchi in Ezra in mite mitmuh in laibu a hong a; mite tunglam ah a om ngal a; huan a hongta a, mite tengteng ading uhi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ezra in Toupa , Pathian thupi a vualzawl hi. Huchi in mipi tengteng in a dawng ua, “Amen, Amen” chi a a khutte uh lik kawm in: a lute uh a kunsak ua a maite ua leisi in Toupa a bia uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Jeshua, Bani, Serebiah, Jamin, Akkub, Sabbethai, Hodiah, Maaseiah, Kelita, Azariah, Jozabad, Hanan, Pelaiah leh Levi mite’n mipite dan theisiam ding in a bawl ua: huchi in mite amau mun ah ading uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Huchi in teltak in laibu ah, Pathian dan sung ah a sim ua; a omdan a taklang ua, huchi a lai simkhiak a theihsiamna ding un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Huan Nehemiah, amah Tirsatha ahi a, leh siampu Ezra Laigelhmi leh Levite mite sinsakte’n, mite tengteng kiang ah, “Tuni Toupa na Pathian uh adia ni siangthou ahi; dah kei unla kap kei un” a chi ua. Dan thute a zak un lah mite tengteng a kap ngal ua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A kiang uah, “Pai unla, thaute ne unla, a khumkhum dawn unla, amah adia bangmah bawlkhol a omlou kiang ah tantuante khak un: tuni lah i Toupa uh adia ni siangthou ahi. Dah kei unla; Toupa a kipahna na hatna uh ahi” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huchi in Levite’n mite tengteng a daisak ua, “Tuni siangthou a hih ziak in, dai un; dah sam kei un” chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Huan mite tengteng ne ding leh, dawn ding leh, vualnopna thupi bawlding in a paita ua, a kiang ua phuankhiak a om thute a theisiamta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A ni nih nin mite tengteng pipute inkaw lupente, siampute leh, Levi mite, Laigelhmi Ezra kiang ah, Dan thute ngaikhe ding in a kikhawm khawm uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Toupa’n Mosi zang a Israel tate a kha sagihna Ankuangluina a aidakbuk a a tendan ding uh a thu a piakdan dan a kigelh a mu uhi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Mual ah kuan khia unla, Olive hiang, gam olive leh muising hiang, tum hiang, sing vunsah hiang, a kigelh bang a, aidakbuk bawlna ding in vala un, a khopi tengteng uh leh Jerusalem a a puankhiak theihna ding un” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Huchi in mite a kuan khia ua, a vala ua, michih in a inn tung ah, a pisate uah, Pathian pisate ah, tui kongpi a mun lian ah leh Ephraim kongpi a mun lian ah aidakbukte a kibawlta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Huan saltanna a kipan hong painawnte omkhawmte tengteng in aidakbukte a bawl ua, aidakbuk ah a teng uhi. Nun tapa Joshua damlai a kipan huai ni tanpha in Israel tate’n lah huchibang in a hih naikei uhi. Huchi in nakpi a kipahna mahmah a omta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Huailou in niteng in ni masapen a kipan ni tawpni tan in Pathian Dan laibu sung ah a sim hi. Huan Ankuangluina ni sagih a nei ua; a ni giatni in thuseh dungzui in kikhopna thupi a omta hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hiai kha ni sawmnih leh li ni’n Israel tate anngawl kawm leh, saiip puansilh kawm leh a tung ua lei kibuak kawm in a kikhawm ua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Huchi in Israel chite mikhual tengteng a kipan in a ki koihtuam ua, ading ua a khelhnate uleh, a pipute uh thulimlouhnate thupha a tawi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A mun uah ading ua, Toupa a Pathian uh danlaibu sung ah ni khat a a seh lina teng a sim ua; a seh lina teng thupha a tawi ua, Toupa a Pathian uh a beta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Huchihlai in Levi mite, Jeshua, Bani, Kadmiel, Sebaniah, Bunni, Serebiah, Bani leh Kenanite dohkan tung ah ading ua, Toupa a Pathian kiang uah aw ngaihtak in a kikou uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Huailai in Levi mite, Jeshua, Kadmiel, Bani, Hasabneiah, Serebiah, Hodiah, Sebaniah leh Pethahiah te’n, “Ding unla tangtawn a kipan tangtawn pha in Toupa na Pathian uh vualzawl un: huchi in vualzawlna leh phatna tengteng tunglam a tawisang a om, na min thupi a vualzawl in om hen.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ezra in a gen a, “Nang, nang kia mahmah Toupa na hi; Van, vante Van a, sepaihte tengteng, lei leh asung a thil om tengteng, tuipite leh asung ua om tengteng na bawl a, avek un na hawi a; van sepaihte’n nang a hon bia uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Abram tel a, Kaldaite Ur a kipan a amah pikhia a, a kiang a Abraham min pepa, Toupa Pathian na hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Na ma a lungtang ginom na mu a, Kanaan mite, Hit mite, Amor mite, Jebus mite leh Girgas mite gam peding a amah toh thukhun bawlpa, a chite kiang a pe ding in, na thute bawl piching a; nang lah na diktat ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Aigupta a ka pipute uh gimthuakna na mu a, Tuipi San a a kah uh na za a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Pharo tung leh, a sikhate tengteng tung leh, a gam a mite tengteng tung ah chiamtehna leh thillamdangte na ensak a; amaute siatna ding in kisatheitak in a gamtang uh chih lah na thei ngal hi; tuni a bang in, min na kimuh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A ma uah tuipi na khen a, huchi in gamhul tung ah tuipi lak ah a paisuak ua; amau delhte nang tuithuk sung ah, tui hattak sung a suang bang in na pailut hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Huailou in sun in meipi kitung in amaute na pi a; zan in meipi ding in, a paina ding lampi ua vakna amaute kiang a pe ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Sinai vum ah leng na hohsuk a, van a kipan in amau na houpih a, vaihawm dikte leh dan dikte, thuseh leh thupiak hoihte na pia hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Amau kiang ah na khawlni siangthou na theisak a, na sikha Mosi khut in, thupiakte leh, thusehte leh dan amaute na thupiak in na pia hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A gilkial un van a kipan tanghou na pia a, a dangtak un suangpi a kipan amaute adin tui na pawt khesak a, amaute peding a na khut na lik a, gam luahding a kuan ding in amaute thu na pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Himahleh amaute leh a pipute un kisatheitak in a hih ua, a paupeng ua, na thupiakte a ngaikhe kei uhi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Thu a mang nuam kei ua, a lak ua na hih na thillamdangte leng a limsak sam kei uh; himahleh a kiuangsak ua, a helna uah a tanna ua kiknawn ding in heutu khat a sep uhi: himahleh nang ngaidam dia mansa, lainatna a dim leh hehpihsiam, heh mengmeng lou, chitna hau, amaute lehngatsanlou Pathian na hi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ahi, bawngnou sun a bawllai un, Aigupta a kipan a nang hon pikhepa hiai na Pathian ahi, a chi ua, nakpitak a thangpaihnate a bawllai un;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Huchi napi in na chitna tampi ziak in amaute gamdai ah na lehngatsan kei hi: sun in a tung ua kipan meipi ding a paimang kei a, vakna amau peding, zan a mei ding leng, a paina lampi uah amaute piding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Amaute chil di’n na kha hoih na pia a, a kam uah na Manna na phallou kei a, amaute a dangtak un tui na pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ahi, kum sawmli gamdai ah amaute na vak a, bangmah a tasam kei ua; a puansilhte uh a tulkei a, a khepekte uh a bawkkei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Huaiban ah gam leh mite amau a pia a, a tantuante uh dungzui a na piakkhiakte: Sihon gam, Heshbon kumpipa gam leh Bashan kumpipa Og gam a lata uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Van aksite bang in a tate uh na pungsak a, nei ding in a lut ding uh chi a a pi leh pute kiang a na gen bang in gamsung ah na pilut hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Huchi in tate a lut ua gam a neita ua, a ma uah gam a tengte na satpuk a, Kanaante, a kumpite leh, gam a mite, amau khut ah na pia a, huchi a a utdan ua a tung ua a hihtheihna ding un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Khopi hatte, gam hoihte a la ua, thil hoih tengteng a dim innte a nei ua, tuibel sekte, grephuante, olive huante, a tam a tam theikungte: huchi in a ne ua, a vah ua, a hongthau ua, na hoihna thupi ziak in a kipak mahmah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />“Hinapi’n lah thu a mangkei ua, na tung ah a hel ua, na dan a nunglam uah a pai ua, na kiang lam amaute nganawn sak ding a, amaute dem a thugen na zawlneite a that ua, thangpaihna thupi mahmah a bawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Huaiziak in a melmate uh khut ah amau na pia a, amau a hih genthei uh: a buai ni ua na kiang a hong kahlai un, van a kipan in na za a; na chitna tampi dungzui in a melmate uh khut a kipan a amaute hondam ding in hondammite a kiang uah na pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Himahleh a tawldam nung un, na ma ah gilou a hih nawn ua: huaiziak in a melmate uh khut ah amau na nusia a, huchi in amau a tung uah thu a nei ua: hinapi in a hong kihei ua, na kiang a a kah un, van a kipan na za a; na chitnate dungzui in amaute tam veipi na hunkhia hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Na dan a na pilut theihnawnna di’n, amau na dem a: himahleh kisatheitak in a hih ua, na thupiakte a limsakkei ua, na vaihawmte tung ah a khial zawsop uhi, huai mi’n a hih aleh, huai ah a hing ding, liang a sawisak ua, a kiuangsak ua, a za nuam kei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Himahleh kum tampi amau na thuakzou a, na zawlneite in na kha zang in amaute na dem a: himahleh a ngaikhe nuam kei ua: huaiziak in gammite khut ah amau na peta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Huchi napi in na chitna tampite ziak in amaute na hihbei keuhkeuh kei a, na lehngatsan kei; nang lah hehpihthei leh chingthei Pathian na hi ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />“Huaiziak in tuin, ka Pathian uh, thupi Pathian hat leh kihtakhuai, thukhun leh chitna vompa, na ma ah, ka tung uh, ka kumpipate uh tung, ka vaihawmte uh tung, ka siampute uh tung, ka zawlneite uh tung, ka pipute uh tung, na mite, Assuria kumpipate damlai a kipan a tuni tan, na mite tung a, nauveina bangmah thamlou bang in kilang kei hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Akoi abangin ka tung ua hongtung tengteng ah nang na diktat a; nang lah diktak in na hihngal a, kou bel gilou tak in ka hih uhi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Kumpipate leh ka vaihawmte uh hiam, siampute uh hiam, ka pipute uh hiam in na dan a zuikei ua, na thupiakte leh na thu theihpihnate, amaute dem a na theihpihnate lah a ngaikhe nuam sam kei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />A gam uah nang na a semkei ua, na hoih mahmahna ziak a amau na piak, a ma ua na piak gam lian leh hoih, a nasep gilou ua kipan a kilehhei sam kei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Ngai in, tuni in sikhate ka hi ua, a gahnekna ding leh huai a hoihte neihna dia ka pipute uh kiang a na piak gam ahihleh, ngai in, asung ah sikhate ka hi uhi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Ka khelhna ziak ua ka tung ua na koih kumpipate ading in a nak pun mahmah a: a thuthu un, ka pumpite uleh, ka gantate uh tung a thilhihtheihna a nei ua, kou ka nak gim mahmah uhi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Huan hiaite tengteng huchibang hita mah leh thukhun muanhuai ka bawl ua, ka gelh ua; ka vaihawmte uh, ka Levi mite uleh ka siampute un, huai ah suai a kai uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Suaikaite hiaite ahi uh Nehemiah Tirsatha, Hakaliah tapa, leh Zedekiah;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Seraiah, Azariah, Jeremiah;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pashur, Amariah, Malkijah;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hattush, Sebaniah, Malluk;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Harim, Meremoth, Obadiah;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Daniel, Ginnethon, Baruk;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mesullam, Abijah, Mijamin;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Maaziah, Bilgai, Semaiah: hiaite siampute ahi uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Levi mite: huaite, Jeshua, Azaniah tapa, Binnui Henadad tapa, Kadmiel;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A unaute uh, Sebaniah, Hodiah, Kelita, Pelaiah, Hanan;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mikha, Rehob, Hasabiah;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Zakkur, Serebiah, Sebaniah;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hodiah, Bani, Beninu;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mite hausate: Parosh, Pahath moab, Elam, Zattu, Bani;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Bunni, Azgad, Bebai;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Adonijah, Bigvai, Adin;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ater, Hezekiah, Azzur;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hodiah, Hasum, Bezai;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hariph, Anathot, Nebai;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Magpiash, Mesullam, Hezir;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Meshezabel, Zadok, Jaddua;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Pelatiah, Hanan, Anaiah;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hosea, Hananiah, Hasub;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Hallohesh, Pileha, Sobek;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Rehum, Hasabnah, Maaseiah;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Huan Ahijah, Hanan, Anan;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Malluk, Harim, Baanah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Huan mipi lak a a dangte, siampute, Levi mite, Kongkhak ngakte, Lasamite, Nithinim mite, leh gamte a mite lak a kipan amau leh amau Pathian dan lam a kituamsehte tengteng, a zite uh, a tapate uh, a tanute uh, michih theihna leh theihtheihna neite;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />A unaute uh, a miliante uh lam ah a belh chinten ua, Mosi Pathian sikha in a piak Pathian dan a om ding leh, Toupa i Toupa uh thupiak tengteng zuiding leh hih ding a, a vaihawmte leh a thusehte hih ding in hamsia leh kichiamna a bawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Huan i tanute gam a mite pelou ding leh, i tapate adia a tanute uh lalou ding in:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Gam a mite’n khawlni a van hiam annek hiam zuak ding a hontawi uleh, khawlni hiam, ni siang ni hiam in huaite i leikei ding uh: huchi in kum sagihna louhaite lak leh leiba chiteng sik i kidek ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Huailou leng i Pathian uh inn a nasepna ding a kum teng a sekel seh thumna kibasak ding in, dante i kibawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tanghou koihna ding, anpiak thillat gige ading, haltum thillat gige ading, khawlnite, kha thakte, sehsa ankuangte ading, thil siangthoute ading, Israel adia lemna kithoihna bawlna dia khelhna thillatte ading, leh i Pathian inn ua nasepna tengteng ading in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Ai i san ua, siampute, Levi mite leh mite, sing thillat ading in, dan a kigelh bang a, i Pathian uh Toupa maitam tung a khul ding, kum teng a, hunsehsa, i pipute inkawte dungzui a, i Pathian inn ua laklut ding in:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Toupa inn a, kum teng a, i lei theigah masapente, sing chiteng a gah tengteng a kipan gahmasapente, tawi ding in:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Dan a kigelh bang in, i tapate lak a piang masapen leh i gantate lak a leng, i bawnghonte lak leh i belamhonte lak a nou masapente, i Pathian inn ua nasem siampute kiang a i Pathian inn ua tawi ding in:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />I tangbuang mek masakpen uleh, i vei thillatte uleh, sing chiteng gah, uain leh thau, i Pathian uh inn a dantante ah, siampute kiang ah i tawiding uh; huan i louma a sawmakhatte Levi mite kiang ah; amau, Levi mite’n, singtang khopi tengteng uah sawm a khat a la uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Aron tapa siampu, Levi mite’n sawm a khat a lak chiang un, Levi mite kiang ah a om ding: huchi in Levi mite’n sawmakhatte sawm a khat i Pathian inn uah, dantante ah, sumbawm inn ah a tawitou ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Israel tate leh Levi tate’n buh leh bal vei, uain, thau, thillat munsiang tuium-belsuan, nasem siampute, kongkhak ngakte leh lasamite omna, munsiangthou a tawi ding uh ahi: Huchi in i Pathian inn i nuse kei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huchi in mite vaihawmte Jerusalem ah a teng ua: midangte’n leng, khopi siangthou Jerusalem a teng ding sawm lak a khat leh khopi dangte a teng dia seh kuate theihna ding in ai a san uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mite’n Jerusalem a tengding a uttak a amau leh amau kipete tengteng a vualzawlta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Huchi in Jerusalem a teng bialsung a hausate hiaite ahi uh: himahleh Judah khopite ah michih amau khopite uah michih a tanchiat uah amau a teng ua, huaite, Israel siampute, Levi mite leh Nithinim mite leh, Solomon sikhate tate.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Jerusalem ah Judah tate lak a leh Benjamin tate lak a kuate hiam a teng uhi. Judah tate lak ah: Athaiah Uzziah tapa, Zekariah tapa, Amariah tapa, Sephatiah tapa, Mahalaleel tapa, Perez tate lak ah;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Maaseiah Baruk tapa, Kolhozeh tapa, Hazaiah tapa, Adaiah tapa, Joiarib tapa, Zekariah tapa, Siloni tapa.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Jerusalem a teng Perez tapate tengteng za li sawmguk leh giat pasal hangsan ahi uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hiaite Benjamin tapate ahi uh: Sallu, Mesullam tapa, Joed tapa, Pedaiah tapa, Kolaiah tapa, Maaseiah tapa, Ithiel tapa, Jesaiah tapa.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Huai nung in Gabbai, Sallai, za kua sawmnih leh giat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Huan Joel Zikri tapa a heutu uh ahi: huan Judah Senuah tapa khopi tung a nihna ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Siampute lak ah: Jedaiah, Joiarib tapa, Jakin tapa,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Seraiah, Hilkiah tapa, Mesullam tapa, Zadok tapa, Meraioth tapa, Ahitub tapa, Pathian inn a vaihawm,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />leh a unaute uh huai in a nasep sem, za giat sawmnih leh nih: huan Adaiah Jeroham tapa, Pelaliah tapa, Amzi tapa, Zekariah tapa, Pashur tapa, Malkijah tapa,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Leh a unaute, pipute inkawte hausate, za nih sawmli leh nih: huan Amasai Azarel tapa, Ahzai tapa, Mesillemoth tapa, Immer tapa,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />leh a unaute uh, mi hat hangsante, za leh sawmnih leh giat: huan a heutu uh Zabdiel, Haggedolim tapa ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Levi mite lak ah: Semaiah, Hassub tapa, Azrikam tapa, Hasabiah tapa, Bunni tapa;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Sabbethai leh Jozabad, Levi mite hausate lak a, Pathian in pawlam nasep a heutu;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mattaniah, Mikha tapa, Zabdi tapa, Asaph tapa, thumna a kipahthugen pankhe pipen ahi: Huan Bakbukiah, a unaute lak a nihna; huan Abda, Sammua tapa, Galal tapa, Jeduthun tapa.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Khopi siangthou sung a Levi mite tengteng za nih sawmgiat leh li.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Huai ban ah kongkhak ngakte, Akkub, Talmon, leh a unaute uh kongpite ngakte, za sawmsagih leh nih ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Huan Israel lak a omlaite, siampute lak a, Levi mite, Judah khopite tengteng ah a om ua, michih a gouluahna chiat uah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Himahleh Ophel ah Nithinim mite a teng uh: huan Ziha leh Gispa Nithinim mite tung ah a om uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Jerusalem a Levi mite heutu leng Bani tapa Uzzi ahi, Hasabiah tapa, Mattaniah tapa, Mikha tapa, Asaph tapate, Pathian inn nasepna a lasamite;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Amau tungtang thu ah kumpipa a kipan a thupiak, ni teng a a kiphamoh bang in, lasamite ading a dan kipsa lah a om ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Huan Pethahiah, Meshezabel tapa, Judah tapa Zerah tate lak a mipite tungtang thu tengteng amah kumpipa khut ah a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Khuate, a lute uh toh ahihleh, Judah tate lak a a khenkhatte Kiriath Arba leh huai a khuate ah, Dibon leh huai a khuate ah, Jekabzeel leh huai a khotate ah a teng ua;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Jeshua leh Moladah leh, Bethphelet ah;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Hazar-shual leh, Beer–sheba leh huai a khuate ah;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ziklag leh, Mekonah leh huai a Hazar-shual khuate ah;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Enrimmon leh, Zariah leh, Jarmuth ah;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Zanoah, Adullam leh a khotate uah, Lakish leh huai loute, Azekah leh huai a khuate. Huchi in Beer–sheba a kipan Hinnom guam tan in giahbuk a bawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Benjamin tate leng Geba a kipan in a tengtou zel ua, Mikmash leh Aija ah, Bethel leh huai a khuate ah;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Anathoth, Nob, Ananiah ah;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Hazor, Ramah, Gittaim;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Hadid, Zeboim. Neballat;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Lod, leh Ono, khutsiamte guam ah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Huan Judah a Levi mite sehkhen bangzah hiam Benjamin toh a kizom uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan hiaite Sialtiel tapa Zerubbabel toh tontou siampute leh Levi mite ahi uh, Joshua:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Siampute: Seraiah, Jeremiah, Ezra Amariah, Malluk, Hattush;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Sekaniah, Rehum, Meremoth;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Iddo, Ginnetho, Abijah;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Miamin, Maadiah, Bilgah;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Semaiah, Joiarib, Jedaiah;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Sallu, Amok, Hilkiah, Jedaiah. Hiaite siampute lak leh a unaute uh lak a Jeshua damlai a pipente uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Levi mite mah leng: Jeshua, Binnui, Kadmiel, Serebiah, Judah, Mattaniah, kipahthugenna tung a om, amah leh a unaute.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Bakbukiah leh Unni leng, a unaute utoh, biakbuk sung ah a om uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Huan Joshua in Joiakim a suang, Joiakim in Eliasib a suang, Eliasib in Joiada a suang,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Joiada in Jonathan a suang, Jonathan in Jaddua a suang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Huan Joiakim damlai in siampute a om ua, pipute inkawte lupente: Seraiah lak ah Meraiah: Jeremiah lak ah Hananiah;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ezra lak ah Mesullam; Amariah lak ah Jehohanan;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Meliku lak ah Jonathan; Sebaniah lak ah Joseph;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Harim lak ah Adna; Meraioth lak ah Helkai;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Iddo lak ah Zekariah; Ginnethon lak ah Mesullam;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Abijah lak ah Zikri; Miniamin lak ah, Moadiah lak ah Piltai;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Bilgah lak ah Sammua; Semaiah lak ah Jehonathan;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Joiarib lak ah Mattenai; Jedaiah lak ah Uzzi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Sallai lak ah Kallai; Amok lak ah Eber;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hilkiah lak ah Hasabiah; Jedaiah lak ah Nethaneel.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Eliasib, Joiada, Johanan, Jaddua damlai in Levi mite, pipute inkawte lupen a gelh ahi uh: Persia mi Darias vaihawm lai a, siampute toh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Levi tapate, pipute inkawte lupente, Kronikil laibu ah, Eliasib tapa Johanan damlai tanhiala, gelh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Huan Levi mite hausate: Hasabiah, Serebiah, Jeshua, Kadmiel tapa, amau delh a unaute uh, Pathian mi David thupiak dungzui in, indan leh indan kisu in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Mattaniah, Bakbukiah, Obadiah, Mesullam, Talmon, Akkubte kongpite vankoihna dantan kem kongkhak ngakte ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Hiaite Jeshua tapa Joiakim, Jozadak tapa damlai, Nehemiah ukpipa leh Ezra siampu Laigelhmi damlai a om ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Huan Jerusalem kulhbang latna adin a omna tengteng uah Levi mite a zongkhia ua, kipahna toh, kipahthugenna leh, lasak, dakkhutbet, tumgingte leh kaihgingte toh a Jerusalem a amaute honpi ding a, kipahna bawl ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Huchi in lasamite tapate a ki kaikhawm ua, Jerusalem kimvel a phaizang a kipan leh Netophath mite khotate a kipan in;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Bethgilgal a kipan in leng, Geba leh Azmaveth loute a kipan in: lasamite’n lah Jerusalem kimvel in khotate a na bawlta ngal ua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Huchi in siampute leh Levi mite a kisiangsak ua: mite leh kongpite leh kulhbangte a siangsak uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Huchihlai in kulhbang tung ah Judah vaihawmte ka pitou a, kipahthugen leh a hon a pai pawlpi nih ka sep a; huai ah pawl khat kulhbang tung ah ekvum kongpi lam ah a pai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Amau nung ah Hoshaiah leh Judah vaihawmte lak a kimkhat,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Azariah, Ezra, Mesullam,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Judah, Benjamin, Semaiah, Jeremiah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Leh siampute tapate lak a kuate hiam pengkulte toh: Zekariah Jonathan tapa, Semaiah tapa, Mattaniah tapa, Mikaiah tapa, Zakkur tapa, Asaph tapa;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />A unaute, Semaiah, Azarel, Milalai, Gilalai, Maai, Nethaneel, Judah, Hanani Pathian mi David tumging theihte toh; a ma uah Ezra Laigelhmi a om hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tuikhuk kongpi kiang ah, a mazawn tak uah, David khopi dohkang ah a paitou ua, kulhbang toupaina ah, David inn tunglam ah, suahlampang a tui kongpi pha in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Huan a lak ua pawl dang kipahthugente amaute tuak ding in a pai ua, kei amau nung ah, kulhbang tung a, meipi insang tunglam ah, kulhbang lian tanpha in;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Ephraim kongpi tung ah, kongpi lui kiang, ngasa kongpi kiang a Hananel insang, Meah insang, belam kongpi tanpha in: venna kongpi ah ading den uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Huchi in Pathian insung a kipahthugen pawl nihte leh kei, leh ka kiang a vaihawmte lak a a kimkhat ading ua:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Siampute, Eliakim, Maaseiah, Miniamin, Mikaiah, Elioenai, Zekariah, Hananiah, pengkulte toh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Huan Maaseiah, Semaiah, Eleazar, Uzzi, Jehohanan, Malkijah, Elam leh Ezer. Huchi in lasamite’n ngaihtak in, a heutupa uh Jezrahiah toh la a sa uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Huai ni’n kithoihna thupite a lan ua, nuam a sa uhi; Pathian in lah nuamsakna thupi in amau nuam a sasak hi; numeite leh naupangte toh a kipak uhi: huchi in Jerusalem kipahna husa gamlapi tan a leng zak in a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Huai ni’n thohlawmte, vei thillatte, haithak masapente, sawmakhatte koihkhawmna dantante a heutu, Dan in a seh bang a, siampu leh Levite tantuan khochih in a na hihzoh bangzel ua lakhawm ding mite a sep uhi. Judahte bel nasemmi siampute leh Levite ziak in a kipak mahmah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />A Pathian uh indan leh siansakna indan a kem ua, huchibang in lasamite leh kongkhak ngakmite’n David leh, a tapa Solomon thupiak bang in a hihta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />David leh nidanglai a Asaph damlai in lasami heutupen leh Pathian kiang a phatna leh kipahthugenna lasate lah a om ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Huan Zerubbabel damlai leh Nehemiah damlai in Israel tengteng in, ni teng a a kul bang in lasamite leh kongkhak ngakmite tantuan a pe zel uhi: Levi mite ading in a siang a koihtuam ua; Aron tapate ading in Levi mite’n a siang a koihtuam uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huai ni’n mite zak in Mosi laibu a sim ua; Ammon mi leh Moab mi tangtawn in Pathian khawmpi sung ah a lut ding uh ahi kei chih, huai sung a kigelh a mu uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tanghou leh tui a Israel tate dawnlou a, amaute hamsiat ding a, amaute siatna ding a Balaam a lak ziak un: himahleh i Pathian in hamsia vualzawlna a suaksak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Dan a zaklai un, hichi ahi a, gamdangmi suante apan Israel mite kikhen khetuamta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Huan hiai ma in, siampu Eliasib i Pathian inn ua dantante tung a seh a ompa, Tobiah toh kizom in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amah ding in dantan thupi a bawlkhol a, huai ah a malam in anpiak thillatte, begaw leh tuium belsuante leh, buh leh bal, uain, leh thaute sawmakhatte a koih ua, huaite bel Levi mite leh lasamite leh kongkhak ngakmite kiang a thupiak a piak ahi a; huchi in vei thillatte siampute ading in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Himahleh hiai hunte in, Jerusalem ah ka omkei: Babulon kumpipa Artaksarses kum sawmthum leh nih kum in kumpipa kiang ah ka hoh a, ni bangzah hiam nung in kumpipa phalna ka ngen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Huchi in Jerusalem ah ka hong a, Pathian inn pisate sung dantan amah adia a bawlsakna ah, Eliasib in Tobiah adia gilou a hihdan ka theisiam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Huchi in kei a hon dahsak mahmah a: huaiziak in dantan a kipan in Tobiah inn van tengteng ka lawnkhia a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Huan thu ka pia a, dantante a hihsiang ua: huai ah anpiak thillatte leh begaw toh, Pathian inn a tuium-belsuan k’on la nawn hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Levi mite tante amau kiang ah piak nailouh in a om chih ka thei a; huchi in Levi mite leh lasamite, nasep semte michih a loulam ah a taizak uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kei tuh vaihawmmite toh ka kiselta ua, bangding a Pathian inn mangngilh a om ahia? ka chi hi. Amau ka kaikhawm a, a mun uah ka koih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Judah tengteng in buh leh bal leh uain leh thau sawm a khat sumbawm ah a hontawi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Sumbawm ading in sumkemmite ka bawl a, Selemiah siampute, Zadok laigelhmite leh, Levi mite lak ah Pedaiah: huan amau zom in Hanan Zakkur tapate, Mattaniah tapa: muanhuai sim ahi ngal ua, a nasep uh a unaute uh kiang a hawm ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Aw ka Pathian, hiai thu ah hon theigige inla, ka Pathian inn ading a ka nasep hoih ka hihte leh huai a zuihdingte nulkhe ken.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Huailai in Judah ah khawlni a kuate hiam uain suknate chil a, buhphalte hontawi a, huaite toh a sabiltungte van guang ka mu a; uain, grep gahte, theipite van puakgik chichih, khawlni a Jerusalem a hon tawilutte leng: huan annekte a zuak ni uh huai ni’n amaute dem in thu ka gen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Huai ah Tura mite leng a om ua, ngasa a hontawi ua, van chituamtuam toh, Judah tate kiang leh Jerusalem ah khawlni’n a zuak uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Huchi in ken Judahte miliante ka kiselpih a, a kiang uah, “Bang thil gilou ahia hiai na hih ua, khawlni na hihnit uh?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Na pipute un huchibang in a hih ngei ua hia, i Pathian in ei tung leh hiai khopi tung ah hiai hoihlou tengteng a hontun ahi kei maw? Hinapi in nou khawlni hihnin in Israel tung ah thangpaihna tamsem na tun ua” ka chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Huan Jerusalem kongpite khawlni ma a khua mial pat in, hichi ahi a, kongkhakte khak ding in thu ka pia a, khawlni bei matan kihong lou ding in thu ka pia a: ka sikhate lak a a khen kongpi tung ah ka pangsak a, huchi a khawlni a puakgik a hong kilaklut louhna ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Huchi in khatvei hiam nihvei hiam sumsinmite leh van chiteng zuakmite Jerusalem pawlam ah a giak uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Amaute dem in thu ka gen a, a kiang uah, “Bangding a kulhbang kim a giak na hi ua? Na hih nawn uleh, na tung uah khut ka kha ding” ka chilai hi. Huai hun a kipan in khawlni’n a hongpai nawnta kei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Kisiangsak ding leh hong kuan a kongpite ngak ding, khawl ni siangsak ding in, Levi mite thu ka pia hi. Aw ka Pathian, hiai ah leng kei hon theigige in, na chitna letdan dungzui in kei honhawi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Huailai in Judahte Ashdod, Ammon leh Moab numeite kitenpihte leng ka mu hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Huchi in a tate’n Ashdod pau kimkhat leh namdangte pau a zang ua, Judahte pau in a pau theikei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Amaute ka kiselpih a, ka hamsiat khum a, a lak ua kuate hiam ka khen a, a mul uh ka bohkhiaksak a, Pathian lou in ka kichiam sak a, “Na tanute uh a tapate uh ading in na pekei ding ua, na tapate uh ading hiam, noumau ading hiam in leng a tanute uh na la ding uh ahi kei chi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Israel kumpipa Solomon hiaite in a khial kei maw? Hinapiin lah nam tampite lak ah amah bang kumpipa a omkei a, a Pathian it in a om a, Israel tengteng tung ah Pathian in kumpipa in a bawl hi: himahleh amah nangawn numei lamdangte’n a khialsak uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ahihleh hiai gilou mahmah hih ding in, numei lamdangte kitenpih a i Pathian tung a talek ding in, na thu honzui ding ka hi umaw?”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Joiada tapate lak a khat, siampu lian Eliasib tapa, Horon mi Sanballat tanu pasal ahi a: huaiziak in kei a kipan ka delhkhia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Aw ka Pathian, siamputna, siamputna thukhun, leh Levi mite a hihnit ziak un, amau theigige in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Huchi in mikhualte tengteng a kipan in amaute ka sawpsiang a, siampute ading leh Levi mite ading in, michih a nasep uah, nasep dante ka sehsak a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Hunsehsa a sing thillat ading, leh gahmasa ading in. Aw ka Pathian, hoihna ding in kei hon theigige in.
  </para>
</usx>
